review_text:
Help me plz to recover my Instagram because I don’t violate any community guideline and Instagram suspend my account. without any reason? 
Username
@xtushar_x

Hey! 👋 you may have seen me before, I like to write reviews for popular apps. YouTube is probably the most used app ever, and it is very reliable, there is only one issue. Before I state the issue, I want to just say that without YouTube we probably wouldn’t have much to watch other than other actual streaming services (I.e. Netflix prime Disney hulu and so on…) but these streaming services are mostly films and shows and are not made by just anyone. Meanwhile, YouTube is really excellent for that, anyone can post anything. Very thankful for that. The only issue is that maybe there should be some age restrictions because sometimes I see actual 6 YEAR OLDS  filming themselves on their account. This may not be really good for their health. Also YouTube should not be aloud to DELETE peoples accounts when they did absolutely nothing wrong. 😑 Otherwise, YouTube’s a really great app. 
Thanks 🙏 
@R/\/\i+i
